## Attribution Requirements for Data

When using this dataset, please cite:

**In-text citations:**
"According to the House 2026 Elections Tracker (2026), [district] is classified as [category]."

**Bibliography:**
House 2026 Elections Tracker. (2026). Retrieved from https://github.com/[username]/house-2026-elections-tracker

**Data export citations:**
Include source references:
- Race to WH (racetothewh.com) - Electoral classifications
- Wikipedia 2026 House Elections - Candidate names and primary results
- FEC.gov - Campaign finance data
- OpenSecrets.org - PAC donor information
- Track AIPAC - Pro-Israel PAC tracking

